Maintainer: Ron Shillings <ron.shillings@gmail.com>
Description: ribbon video editor
 Folio Reel is a video editor with a ribbon interface, KeyTips and ScreenTips:
 a media bin, a timeline with titles, video, audio and music tracks, trimming,
 splitting and ripple delete with snapping, crossfades and wipes, colour,
 speed, crop and pan-and-zoom, steadying a shaky clip and straightening a
 bent lens, titles and captions, a music bed that dips under speech,
 voice-over, screen and camera recording, and MP4 or WebM export at 720p,
 1080p and 4K. Everything stays on this computer.
